{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155570/extras/887e82ee2e399ded9a7632a6bd88a49e.avif?t=1770635866\" width=640 height=271 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, all of a sudden, you find yourself becoming a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've never committed any evil. Your soul would surely be judged favorably. ...Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It no longer mattered how great of a place it was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thought of being separated from him sounded more terrifying than abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what you need to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't visit him anymore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you have to bring him with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're sure he would understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to bring him to your side before your soul passes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to XXXX your beloved...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155570/extras/2109061d7354b10dae3173fd4a89ea85.avif?t=1770635866\" width=404 height=84 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a point-and-click, command-selection style adventure game where the protagonist is a girl who has become a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is to fulfill her desires by talking to her beloved &quot;Him&quot;, causing poltergeists, visiting in dreams, or even cursing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155570/extras/e61dd969b3c7d8e035d3552019a615ba.avif?t=1770635866\" width=640 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as a ghost, you cannot easily communicate with &quot;Him&quot;, who has no spiritual inspiration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through trial and error, try to bring about the desired outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Estimated Playtime]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story: Approx. 1\u20132 hours (Approx. 15 minutes per ending, with 6 endings in total.)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playtime may vary depending on your choices and pace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Stories: Approx. 1 hour (Includes the prequel &quot;Prologue&quot; and the sequel &quot;Epilogue&quot;.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155570/extras/b107aa2d8e202491d03454be4d0b8aac.webp?t=1770635866\" width=519 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Prologue; the story of your life before becoming a ghost, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and an Epilogue; the story after the main story, have been added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155570/extras/780d16be76e33bf81a276b305395d969.poster.avif?t=1770635866\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155570/extras/780d16be76e33bf81a276b305395d969.webm?t=1770635866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155570/extras/780d16be76e33b